  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Uncle Jr** (1 other source): Setlist lists Shaheed after this song, but the uploader doubts it was played [1]\n- **El Ron** (1 review): Reviewer says the track labeled with this title is actually a different tune [5]\n- **Alladin** (1 review): Reviewer says the track labeled with this title is actually Tuesday Night Squad [5]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tuesday**: rare: 14 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2019-11-08** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 13 songs; 117 min [1]\n- **soulive2019-11-08.matrix**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 13 songs; 116 min [2]\n- **Soulive2019-11-08.AKG-CK63.Flac16**: source not stated; 13 songs; 117 min; rated 4/5 by 2 [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says a listed Shaheed track never actually features Shaheed [5]\n- Guests from TAB played with the band for the whole second half [1]\n- TAB members sat in for the entire second half of the set [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2019-11-08**: taped by Jamie Burks; transferred by Jamie Burks; source: Post Matrix of: SBD + AKG C414B-XLII's(hypers, fob,dfc)~>V3 + Schoeps MK21's~>KCY~>NBox Platinum~>DR680 MKII 24/48 [1]\n- **soulive2019-11-08.matrix**: taped by Keith Antaya; transferred by Keith Antaya; source: 414>V3+Mg20>nbox+SBD>F8 [2]. Also: Taped from the platform rail about three-quarters of the way back; soundboard feed supplied by Julian, patch by Jamie; Conversion went from SDHC card through Adobe Audition 3.0 to CDWave 1.71 [2]\n- **Soulive2019-11-08.AKG-CK63.Flac16**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: AKG CK63 ULS Hyper Mics > nBob Active Cable > nBox Plus > Tascam DR-100MKII (24-Bit/44.1 kHz) [3]",
